 "category": "historic",
 "category_zh": "历史遗址",
 "category_en": "Historic site",
 "intro_zh": "博物馆是以秦始皇兵马俑为基础在兵马俑坑原址上建立的遗址类博物馆，也是中国较大的古代军事博物馆。秦兵马俑坑发现于1974-1976年，秦始皇兵马俑博物馆1979年向国内外开放。兵马俑的发现被誉为世界第八大奇迹、二十世纪考古史上的伟大发现。",
 "intro_en": "The museum is a heritage museum based on the Terracotta Warriors and Horses of Qin Shihuang and was established on the original site of the Terracotta Warriors and Horses Pit. It is also the largest ancient military museum in China. The Qin Terracotta Warriors and Horses pit was discovered between 1974 and 1976, and the Terracotta Warriors and Horses Museum of Qin Shihuang was opened to domestic and foreign visitors in 1979. The discovery of the Terracotta Warriors and Horses is hailed as the eighth wonder of the world and a great discovery in the archaeological history of the 20th century.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
